<title>JAPAN: Japan Sept rubber product output up 5.1 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Japan Sept rubber product output up 5.1 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Japan Rubber Manufacturers' Association said on Tuesday that Japan's rubber product output totalled 123,526 tonnes in September, up 5.1 percent from the same month last year.</p>
<p>Details of rubber product output were as follows, in tonnes:</p>
<p>			  Sept 1996    Aug 1996	 Year/Year</p>
<p> Automobile tyres     92,988	 75,119	  +4.6 pct</p>
<p> Industrial use	 23,463	 20,972	  +3.0 pct</p>
<p> Others		    7,075	  6,461	 +22.0 pct</p>
<p> Total		   123,526	102,552	  +5.1 pct</p>
<p>--Tokyo Commodity Desk +81-3-3432-7431</p>
</text>
